<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>Global Crude Oil Price Trends</h1>
  <p>A comprehensive historical analysis of monthly crude oil prices from 1970 through 2026, identifying key price regimes, shocks, and long-term patterns</p>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- Executive Overview -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Executive Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This report analyzes <strong>{len(df)}</strong> monthly observations of global crude oil prices spanning from
      <strong>{date_min.strftime('%B %Y')}</strong> to <strong>{date_max.strftime('%B %Y')}</strong> — over <strong>{years_span:.1f} years</strong> of data.
      Prices are denominated in nominal US dollars per barrel (USD/bbl).
    </p>
    <p>
